2908..2985 Comment "/// The loops commute (cubical\'s `comm-ΩS¹`): each composite is the spin of"
2986..3064 Comment "/// its winding by `sect`, the windings sum by `windHom`, and the sums commute"
3065..3140 Comment "/// by `plusComm`. Each lemma is read at its written result (#423), and the"
3141..3197 Comment "/// calls in the types stand as what they return (#426)."
